WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.463
Everyone passed. Who comes first?

00:00:33.463 --> 00:01:05.847
Start with shared analysed terms

00:01:05.847 --> 00:01:35.730
Two records or nine?

00:01:35.730 --> 00:02:06.414
Count documents, not repetitions

00:02:06.414 --> 00:02:39.815
Add weighted contributions

00:02:39.815 --> 00:03:24.367
A lexical score cannot supply every missing expression
